### 🛡️ TEST MULTI-YEAR BILL SUPPORT
### This tests the ability to create bills for any year (past, present, or future)
### Year restriction has been REMOVED as of January 10, 2026

### Step 1: Login (replace with your actual credentials)
POST https://localhost:7299/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-email@example.com",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Test 1: ✅ SHOULD WORK - Create bill for current year (2026)
POST https://localhost:7299/api/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billName": "Current Year Electric Bill",
  "billType": "utility",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "dueDate": "2026-12-15T00:00:00Z",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "provider": "Electric Company",
  "referenceNumber": "ELE2026001",
  "autoGenerateNext": false,
  "notes": "Current year 2026"
}

### Test 2: ✅ SHOULD WORK - Create bill for previous year (2025)
POST https://localhost:7299/api/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billName": "2025 Water Bill",
  "billType": "utility", 
  "amount": 75.00,
  "dueDate": "2025-06-15T00:00:00Z",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "provider": "Water Company",
  "referenceNumber": "WAT2025001",
  "autoGenerateNext": false,
  "notes": "Previous year 2025 - Historical bill"
}

### Test 3: ✅ SHOULD WORK - Create bill for past year (2024)
POST https://localhost:7299/api/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billName": "2024 Gas Bill",
  "billType": "utility",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "dueDate": "2024-08-15T00:00:00Z",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "provider": "Gas Company", 
  "referenceNumber": "GAS2024001",
  "autoGenerateNext": false,
  "notes": "Past year 2024 - Historical bill"
}

### Test 4: ✅ SHOULD WORK - Create bill for future year (2027)
POST https://localhost:7299/api/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billName": "2027 Internet Bill",
  "billType": "utility",
  "amount": 89.99,
  "dueDate": "2027-03-20T00:00:00Z",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "provider": "Internet Provider",
  "referenceNumber": "INT2027001", 
  "autoGenerateNext": false,
  "notes": "Future year 2027"
}

### Test 5: ✅ SHOULD WORK - Create 2025 bill with auto-generation
### Should auto-generate bills for remaining months of 2025 only
POST https://localhost:7299/api/bills
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "billName": "2025 Phone Bill Auto-Gen",
  "billType": "utility",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "dueDate": "2025-01-10T00:00:00Z",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "provider": "Phone Company",
  "referenceNumber": "PHN2025001",
  "autoGenerateNext": true,
  "notes": "Should auto-generate for Feb-Dec 2025"
}

### Test 6: Update existing bill to different year
### First get a bill ID, then update it
GET https://localhost:7299/api/bills?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Test 7: Update bill date to previous year (use bill ID from Test 6)
PUT https://localhost:7299/api/bills/{{bill_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dueDate": "2025-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Updated to 2025"
}

### Test 8: Get all bills to verify multi-year support
GET https://localhost:7299/api/bills?page=1&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Test 9: Get bills filtered by year and month (2025)
GET https://localhost:7299/api/bills/by-month?year=2025&month=6
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Test 10: Get bills filtered by year and month (2024)
GET https://localhost:7299/api/bills/by-month?year=2024&month=8
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Expected Results:
### Test 1-5: ✅ ALL SHOULD SUCCEED - Bills created for any year
### Test 6-7: ✅ SHOULD SUCCEED - Bill date updated to different year
### Test 8: Should show bills from multiple years (2024, 2025, 2026, 2027)
### Test 9-10: Should show bills from specific year/month combinations

### Note: Year restriction has been removed as of January 10, 2026
### Users can now add bills from any year (past, present, or future)
